#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.transform:1
msgid "Interpolate ``X`` from ``x_axis`` onto ``common_x_axis_``."
msgstr "Interpola ``X`` desde ``x_axis`` sobre ``common_x_axis_``."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.transform:3
msgid ""
"For routed ``Pipeline.transform`` calls, request ``x_axis`` via "
"``set_transform_request(x_axis=True)``. For routed ``fit`` or "
"``fit_transform`` calls, also configure ``set_fit_request(x_axis=True)`` so "
"the two phases have matching requests."
msgstr ""
"Para las llamadas enrutadas a ``Pipeline.transform``, solicite ``x_axis`` "
"mediante ``set_transform_request(x_axis=True)``. Para las llamadas enrutadas "
"a ``fit`` o ``fit_transform``, configure también "
"``set_fit_request(x_axis=True)`` para que ambas fases tengan solicitudes "
"coincidentes."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.transform:9
msgid "Signal values sampled on ``x_axis``."
msgstr "Valores de señal muestreados en ``x_axis``."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.transform:11
msgid ""
"Either shape ``(n_features,)`` (shared grid for every row) or ``(n_samples, "
"n_features)`` (per-row grid). Must be strictly increasing along the feature "
"axis."
msgstr ""
"Debe tener la forma ``(n_features,)`` (cuadrícula compartida por todas las "
"filas) o ``(n_samples, n_features)`` (cuadrícula por fila). Debe ser "
"estrictamente creciente a lo largo del eje de características."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.transform:16
msgid "**X_transformed**"
msgstr "**X_transformed**"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.fit_transform:1
msgid "Fit to data, then transform it."
msgstr "Ajusta los datos y, a continuación, los transforma."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.fit_transform:3
msgid ""
"``fit`` does not consume ``x_axis``; only ``transform`` does. This custom "
"implementation ensures ``x_axis`` is forwarded only to ``transform``, not to "
"``fit``."
msgstr ""
"``fit`` no consume ``x_axis``; solo lo hace ``transform``. Esta "
"implementación personalizada garantiza que ``x_axis`` se reenvíe únicamente "
"a ``transform`` y no a ``fit``."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.fit_transform:11
msgid "Input grid for interpolation, forwarded to ``transform``."
msgstr ""
"Cuadrícula de entrada para la interpolación, reenviada a ``transform``."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.fit_transform:14
msgid "**X_new**"
msgstr "**X_new**"

